  "description": "Scalar-field template-parameter substitution (esm-spec \u00a79.6.1 / \u00a79.6.3 constraint 5): one `total` template whose `body` carries a parameter name (`K_semiring`) as the string VALUE of the scalar `semiring` field of a `faq` node \u2014 a substitution site, the exact mirror of the match-side scalar-field binding rule \u2014 instantiated twice with different semiring literals (sum_product, max_sum). All five bindings MUST expand both observeds to the same post-substitution nodes (expanded.esm); the bound value must be a literal admissible for the field, enforced on the EXPANDED form (\u00a79.6.9; tests/conformance/expression_templates/per_instantiation_validation). Re-pointed from the `manifold` field of the geometry leaf removed at esm 2.0.0.",
